---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
    <main
        class="flex flex-col items-center pt-8 w-full min-h-screen container mx-auto mb-10 text-center"
    >
        <div class="w-full px-5">
            <h1 class="font-bold text-4xl mb-5">What is FTC?</h1>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-10 text-left">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-5 text-primary">Basics of FTC</h2>
                    <p>
                        FIRST Tech Challenge is an international robotics
                        competition designed for students in grades 7-12. Teams
                        design, build, and program robots to compete
                        head-to-head in alliance-based matches. The competition
                        includes local qualifiers, regional/state championships,
                        and culminates at the world-level FIRST Championship.
                        Teams are also judged in areas such as design, community
                        outreach, and technical innovation.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-5 text-primary">Who Participates</h2>
                    <ul class="list-inside list-disc space-y-2">
                        <li>
                            <span class="text-primary">
                                Students (grades 7-12)
                            </span>
                            : The core team members who design, build, and program
                            the robot.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="text-primary">
                                Mentors and Coaches
                            </span>
                            : Often volunteer engineers, educators, or parents who
                            guide teams through technical development and strategy.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="text-primary">
                                Volunteers and Event Staff
                            </span>
                            : Assist with running events and supporting teams throughout
                            the season.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <span class="text-primary">
                                FIRST Organization & Regional Partners
                            </span>
                            : They set the rules, game themes, organize the season,
                            provide resources, and manage progression through the
                            competition hierarchy.
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-5 text-primary">
                        Decode 2025-26 Game
                    </h2>
                    <h2 class="text-xl mb-2 text-primary">Autonomous (30 s)</h2>
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        Robots decode motif, score artifacts, build patterns,
                        move off launch line
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="text-xl mb-2 text-primary">
                        Driver-Control (2 min)
                    </h2>
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        Teams collect and score artifacts, finish pattern,
                        return robots to base
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="text-xl mb-2 text-primary">Scoring</h2>
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        Points for artifacts, patterns, maze decoding, robot
                        returns; ranking points also
                    </p>
                    <h2 class="text-xl mb-2 text-primary">Strategic Themes</h2>
                    <p class="mb-2">
                        Randomization, teamwork, dual-phase planning,
                        cooperative gameplay
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>; ---
